Package: MetaboSetR
Type: Package
Title: Biocrates Q1000 Metabolomics Preprocessing and Pathway-Set Enrichment
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Jun-Yeong Heo <fleatinum@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Jun-Yeong Heo <fleatinum@gmail.com>
Description: Preprocesses Biocrates MxP Quant 1000 WebIDQ exports and
    performs metabolite-level feature statistics, curated pathway-set GSEA,
    and pathway-set over-representation analysis (ORA) against curated
    immunometabolism sets plus external metabolite-level sets (Reactome,
    WikiPathways, SMPDB via RaMP-DB; LION lipid ontology; Plant/Microbe
    origin and disease-association sets), with KEGG/HMDB/PubChem/ChEBI/
    RefMet/LIPID MAPS/LION id annotations for KEGG-map overlays. See
    DESIGN.md for the full design.
